{"id":"n40590-2-7","stage":3,"title":"다짐 · 决心","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40590-2-7-1","ko":"담배를 끊겠다던 다짐은 벌써 잊어버린 거야?","zh":"你说要戒烟的决心，早就忘掉了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"담배를","meaning":"烟，香烟","explanation":"담배：烟，香烟；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"담배","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63662","senseId":"2","lemma":"담배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담배를","audio":"/audio/42d7c00aa4cfe434f732.mp3"}},{"text":"끊겠다던","meaning":"戒","explanation":"끊다：戒；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다던：引用以前听到的陈述，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"끊다","audio":"/audio/c2d51c5ca94e5957669b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62839","senseId":"4","lemma":"끊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끊겠다던","audio":"/audio/7885a931d80d05a67f27.mp3"}},{"text":"다짐은","meaning":"决心，誓","explanation":"다짐：决心，誓；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"다짐","audio":"/audio/8c732c7f9f0e56a5f6eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40590","senseId":"2","lemma":"다짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다짐은","audio":"/audio/fe57dd11c38ae53990ce.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"잊어버린","meaning":"忘掉","explanation":"잊어버리다：忘掉；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"잊어버리다","audio":"/audio/5a16c9c25daf9c4e4c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89801","senseId":"1","lemma":"잊어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잊어버린","audio":"/audio/f137956e2b6457b82df6.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"10c7c905412d5254","term":"담배","zh":"烟，香烟","audio":"/audio/10c7c905412d52542ee4.mp3","entryId":"63662","definition":"把晒干的烟叶切成细条用纸卷起，制成点火后供吸入其烟雾的物品。","pronunciation":["담ː배"]},{"id":"c2d51c5ca94e5957","term":"끊다","zh":"戒","audio":"/audio/c2d51c5ca94e5957669b.mp3","entryId":"62839","definition":"不再做习惯性的行为。","pronunciation":["끈타"]},{"id":"8c732c7f9f0e56a5","term":"다짐","zh":"决心，誓","audio":"/audio/8c732c7f9f0e56a5f6eb.mp3","entryId":"40590","definition":"下狠心或打定主意。","pronunciation":["다짐"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"5a16c9c25daf9c4e","term":"잊어버리다","zh":"忘掉","audio":"/audio/5a16c9c25daf9c4e4c13.mp3","entryId":"89801","definition":"本来知道的事情记不住或记不起来。","pronunciation":["이저버리다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/ee58e5ae358995dfa0c2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40590-2-7-2","ko":"금연을 마음먹긴 했는데 생각처럼 잘 안 돼.","zh":"虽然下定决心要戒烟，但并不像想的那么容易。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"금연을","meaning":"戒烟","explanation":"금연：戒烟；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"금연","audio":"/audio/00ec645587cb9417a86a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60641","senseId":"2","lemma":"금연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금연을","audio":"/audio/6e3d8af6d9e3fcc94292.mp3"}},{"text":"마음먹긴","meaning":"下决心","explanation":"마음먹다：下决心；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"마음먹다","audio":"/audio/9263052b9fa9c5a205a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15726","senseId":"1","lemma":"마음먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음먹긴","audio":"/audio/d653cebeb1132c624bb0.mp3"}},{"text":"했는데","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했는데","audio":"/audio/611559268d2f3c6eead9.mp3"}},{"text":"생각처럼","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；처럼：表示相似：“像……一样”。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각처럼","audio":"/audio/f09ae3c6e83f3311053e.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"00ec645587cb9417","term":"금연","zh":"戒烟","audio":"/audio/00ec645587cb9417a86a.mp3","entryId":"60641","definition":"曾经抽烟的人戒除吸香烟的嗜好。","pronunciation":["그ː면"]},{"id":"9263052b9fa9c5a2","term":"마음먹다","zh":"下决心","audio":"/audio/9263052b9fa9c5a205a3.mp3","entryId":"15726","definition":"在心中考虑或决定做某事。","pronunciation":["마음먹따"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4c8d9f22bcf576eb5284.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.117,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40590","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":113,"sequenceScore":2.9437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["虽然下定决心要戒烟，但并不像想的那么容易。","你说要戒烟的决心，早就忘掉了吧？","你衣服穿反了吧？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你说要戒烟的决心，早就忘掉了吧？","你衣服穿反了吧？","虽然下定决心要戒烟，但并不像想的那么容易。"],"answer":2}]}
